  not written ⇒ `FSp U s t (400 (c + X))` (and `fok U` from `fok O`).
* `encK_pushSt`, `agree_pushSt`, **`leafPush`**: a uniform leaf `withPushI pl (fcode U)` from the
  non-uniform spec of `O` on the background with the pushed parameters.
